    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nChi ce l’ha recupera un po’ di PS ogni volta\nche infligge danni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. The holder\nrestores a little HP every time it inflicts damage\non others.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせた　ポケモンが　攻撃して\n相手に　ダメージを　あたえたとき\nＨＰを　少し　回復できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当携带它的宝可梦\n攻击对手并造成伤害时，\n能回复少量ＨＰ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Debe llevarlo un Pokémon. Cada vez que este inflige\ndaño, recupera algunos PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
